# DEFECT D-1: obslua.script_log(level, "") dereferences a NULL buffer in the reference (the scratch string is
# freed by the empty copy, then searched for a newline) and crashes the host process.  Required behaviour of a
# re-implementation: log nothing and carry on.  The reference crash is captured with a forked child ("try").
scripting load
lua_begin crash.lua
obslua.script_log(obslua.LOG_INFO, "before")
obslua.script_log(obslua.LOG_INFO, "")
print("survived")
lua_end
try create S0 crash.lua
